Package: qore-nats-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-nats-module-doc
Description: NATS messaging, JetStream and key-value providers for Qore
 This package provides native NATS bindings and source/compiled user modules
 for messaging, JetStream streams/consumers and key-value storage.
 Compiler metadata, provider resources and translations are included.
 The distribution NATS C client library supplies the native implementation.

Package: qore-nats-module-doc
Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-nats-module
Description: documentation and examples for Qore's NATS modules
 This package contains four HTML API references and local-broker test
 fixtures for the NATS messaging and data provider modules.
